enerating an estimated <strong>$2,379,093</strong> in revenue across the 50 top-ranked ASINs for this search term. Demand is heavily concentrated at the top of the ranking — the ten best performers capture <strong>58.6%</strong> of unit volume and 54.6% of revenue, while a typical listing is priced at $339.72.<!--[--> The keyword itself pulled 307,815 Amazon queries over the same period<!--[--> (<span class="text-emerald-600">▲ 15.4%</span> MoM)<!--]-->.<!--]--></p><p> Zooming out to the 12-month window ending July 2026, the <strong>mini pc</strong> Top 50 moved <strong>63,750 units</strong> and <strong>$17,530,100</strong> in cumulative sales — an average of 5,313 units and $1,460,842 per month. Monthly throughput topped out at 7,200 units in June 2026 and dipped to 2,850 in May 2026, leaving the latest reading <strong>6.1% higher</strong> than August 2025. </p></div><div class="mb-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-solid border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 text-center shadow-sm md:py-6"><span class="text-2xl font-black tabular-nums tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-3xl">63.8K</span><span class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium leading-tight text-gray-500 md:text-xs">Total units sold · Last 12 months</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-solid border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 text-center shadow-sm md:py-6"><span class="text-2xl font-black tabular-nums tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-3xl">$17.5M</span><span class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-medium leading-tight text-gray-500 md:text-xs">Total revenue · Last 12 months</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-solid border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 text-center shadow-sm md:py-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-2xl font-black tabular-nums tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-3xl">307.8K</span><span class="bg-emerald-100 text-eme