-center justify-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-extrabold tracking-wide text-white transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 md:text-base"><span>See the Top 10 ASINs driving 58.6% of sales</span><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-y-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 3a.75.75 0 01.75.75v10.638l3.96-4.158a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-5.25 5.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-5.25-5.5a.75.75 0 111.08-1.04l3.96 4.158V3.75A.75.75 0 0110 3z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16 pt-8 md:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="xl:gap-16 lg:flex lg:items-start lg:gap-12"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-10"><section id="top10-overview" class="scroll-mt-8"><h2 class="mb-3 mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 lg:text-3xl">Mini Pc Market Share &amp; Sales Concentration on Amazon US — July 2026</h2><div class="report-prose mb-4 space-y-3"><p> The most-sold mini pc listing on Amazon US in July 2026 is <strong>ASIN B099KSJN8P<!--[--> (Brand: KAMRUI)<!--]--></strong>, which sold <strong>1,000 units</strong> at $279.99 apiece — equal to <strong>14.3%</strong> of every unit tracked in this report<!--[--> and 2.5× the volume of the No. 2 listing<!--]-->. </p><p> The Top 10 ASINs account for <strong>4,100 units</strong> and <strong>$1,298,347</strong> in July 2026 — <strong>58.6%</strong> of unit volume and <strong>54.6%</strong> of revenue among all 50 ranked ASINs in this report. </p></div></section><section id="top10" class="scroll-mt-8 space-y-6"><div class="space-y-4"><div data-module="asinsight_pseo_sales:top_10_rank" class="rounded-xl border border-solid border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xl md:p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-6 md:mb-6"><div class="flex flex-col md:max-w-[70%] lg:max-w-[75%]"><h3 id="top10-sales-volume-title" class="text-xl font-black