at just broke into the Top 10, and the ones growing fastest month over month. <!--[-->Specifically, 2 ASINs forced its way in: <strong>B0GFCMGHJT</strong> booked <strong>300 units</strong> at $249.99<!--[-->, with <strong>▲ 50.0%</strong> MoM change<!--]-->.<!--]--><!--[--> On the growth side, <strong>B099KSJN8P</strong> leads positive momentum with <strong>▲ 100.0%</strong> MoM growth on 1K units<!---->.<!--]--></p><p> The two signals carry different weight. A fresh entrant means share has already changed hands — an incumbent gave up its place to make room, so any competitive set drawn up a month ago is now out of date. A steep growth rate works as the earlier warning: it marks demand that is still compounding, usually a month or two before the ranking catches up to it. </p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><div class="border-2 border-emerald-600 bg-white hover:border-emerald-700 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5"><span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">New to Top 10</span></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-5 pt-4"><div class="mb-4"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-2xs shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white transition-transform group-hover:scale-105" style="width:84px;height:84px;"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712dcx4GO3L._AC_UY512_.jpg" alt="GMKtec G3S Mini PC Computers Intel N95 Processor (Turbo 3.4GHz) | 8GB DDR4 256GB SSD Desktop Computer 4K Dual HDMI Display/3x USB3.2/WiFi 5 BT5.0/RJ45 Ethernet" loading="lazy" class="h-full w-full object-contain"></div></div><div class="space-y-2 text-center"><p aria-label="ASIN" clas